%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'flowchart': {'htmlLabels': false}}}%%
flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> recv[receive query from Supervisor\n+ case_id + conversation_history]

    recv --> planner[planner\ngenerate JSON plan\nsteps + tools + depends_on\nhigh-tier LLM]
    planner --> validator[plan_validator\ncheck: unknown tools?\nempty queries? invalid depends_on?\nsteps > 5?]

    validator --> val_result{valid?}
    val_result -->|INVALID retry_count < 3| planner
    val_result -->|INVALID retry exhausted| fail_hard[return error\nstatus=failed]
    fail_hard --> trace_w
    val_result -->|VALID| fanout_exec

    subgraph fanout_exec[executor_fanout - Parallel Send per independent step]
        direction LR
        sw1[step_worker\ncall tool]
        sw2[step_worker\ncall tool]
        sw3[step_worker\ncall tool]

        sw1 --> tool1{tool}
        sw2 --> tool2{tool}
        sw3 --> tool3{tool}

        tool1 -->|case_doc_rag| r1[CaseDocRAG\nMCPClient.call]
        tool1 -->|civil_law_rag| r2[CivilLawRAG\nMCPClient.call]
        tool1 -->|fetch_summary_report| r3[SummaryReport\nMongoDB fetch]
        tool2 -->|any tool| r4[result]
        tool3 -->|any tool| r5[result]
    end

    fanout_exec --> collector[collector\ngather all step_results\nexecute dependent steps after prereqs]
    collector --> col_router{all steps\ndone?}

    col_router -->|more independent steps| fanout_exec
    col_router -->|tool error - replan| replan_check1{replan_count\n< 2?}
    replan_check1 -->|YES| replanner[replanner\nrewrite plan\nincrement replan_count\nhigh-tier LLM]
    replanner --> replan_status{status =\nfailed?}
    replan_status -->|YES guard tripped| trace_w
    replan_status -->|NO| validator

    replan_check1 -->|NO| synthesizer

    col_router -->|all done| synthesizer[synthesizer\nproduce final Arabic answer\nhigh-tier LLM]

    synthesizer --> suf_check{sufficient?}
    suf_check -->|YES| trace_w[trace_writer\nwrite to MongoDB\nchat_reasoner_traces]
    suf_check -->|NO| replan_check2{replan_count\n< 2?}
    replan_check2 -->|YES| replanner
    replan_check2 -->|NO best-effort| trace_w

    trace_w --> END_OK([END - AgentResult to Supervisor])
